This metadata-only edition contains no official law text.

German statutes and other official works are governed by section 5 of the German Copyright Act (Urheberrechtsgesetz). The source licence for each future law text must be assessed and attributed when that text is added.

The inspected Hamburg gazette dataset names Datenlizenz Deutschland – Namensnennung – Version 2.0 (dl-de-by-2.0). That licence applies to that dataset; it does not grant rights to unrelated material on the consolidated Landesrecht portal.
